---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — SFBrews"
  description="About SFBrews, our all-grain BrewZilla 4.1.1 setup, and brewing philosophy."
>
  <div class="outer page-wrap">
    <div class="canvas">
      <header class="md-about-hero md-reveal">
        <span class="about-badge">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined filled" aria-hidden="true">sports_bar</span>
          Brewhouse Profile
        </span>
        <h1>About SFBrews</h1>
        <p>
          Welcome to <strong>SFBrews</strong>—a personal homebrewing journal documenting brewday writeups, recipe formulations, split-batch experiments, equipment reviews, and competition results.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="spec-grid md-reveal">
        <div class="md-card spec-card">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined spec-icon" aria-hidden="true">water_heater</span>
          <h3>BrewZilla Gen 4.1.1</h3>
          <p>All-grain electric brewing system with RAPT PID step-mash control, dish base drain, and pumped mash recirculation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="md-card spec-card">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined spec-icon" aria-hidden="true">grain</span>
          <h3>Recipe Formulation</h3>
          <p>Balanced grist builds, hop schedules, and iterative batch adjustments informed by tasting notes and BJCP feedback.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="md-card spec-card">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined spec-icon" aria-hidden="true">water_drop</span>
          <h3>Water Chemistry</h3>
          <p>Tailored mineral additions and mash pH control matched to classic and modern beer styles.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="md-card spec-card">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined spec-icon" aria-hidden="true">kitchen</span>
          <h3>Fermentation &amp; Cellar</h3>
          <p>Temperature-controlled fermentation, pressure spunding, and draft dispensing.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="md-card prose-card prose md-reveal">
        <h2>Adding a New Post</h2>
        <p>
          Every writeup lives as a simple Markdown file in <code>src/content/posts/</code>. Include a <code>recipe</code> block in the frontmatter to automatically render the recipe specification and Malt Bill table with grist percentages.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-wrap {
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }

  .md-about-hero {
    background-color: var(--md-sys-color-surface-container-low);
    border: 1px solid var(--md-sys-color-outline-variant);
    border-radius: var(--md-sys-shape-corner-extra-large);
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    box-shadow: var(--md-sys-elevation-1);
  }

  .about-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: var(--md-sys-shape-corner-full);
    background-color: var(--md-sys-color-primary-container);
    color: var(--md-sys-color-on-primary-container);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .about-badge .material-symbols-outlined {
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .md-about-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface);
  }

  .md-about-hero p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface-variant);
  }

  .spec-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .spec-card {
    padding: 1.35rem;
    border-radius: var(--md-sys-shape-corner-large);
  }

  .spec-icon {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: var(--md-sys-shape-corner-medium);
    background-color: var(--md-sys-color-secondary-container);
    color: var(--md-sys-color-on-secondary-container);
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .spec-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .spec-card p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface-variant);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .prose-card {
    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--md-sys-shape-corner-extra-large);
  }

  .prose-card h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .prose-card p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .page-wrap {
      padding-top: 1.25rem;
    }

    .spec-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
